  id: frost_reaver
  displayName: Frost Reaver
  description: In the Frozen Peaks, hunting at the treeline. Tier 2. Tracks the player
    as much as the player tracks it.
  tier: 2
  family: 2
  behaviors:
  - Stays at edge of player's vision, watching.
  - Engages only when player commits to an action (drinking, crafting, etc).
  - 'Phase 1: hit-and-run. Phase 2: full combat.'
  - Can freeze the player solid briefly with a successful claw hit.
  abilities:
  - "Hunter's Mark \u2014 telegraph attack from far range"
  - "Frost Claw \u2014 close-range, may freeze"
  - "Pack Howl \u2014 summons 2 wolves to support"
  - "Reaver's Charge \u2014 single high-damage commitment"
  dropItemIds:
  - Reaver's Pelt (cryo armor)
  - Frost-Bone Claw (weapon)
  - Thick Pelt x3
  - Spirit Anchor
  boss_section: Hunter Family
  isBoss: 1
  isFinale: 0
  baseHealth: 30
  baseSpeed: 4
